\title{scSimEvalStudio: Interactive Shiny Studio for scSimEval Single-Cell Multiomics Benchmarking}
\description{
Companion graphical Shiny web interface for the 'scSimEval' Bioconductor package. Enables interactive uploading of single-cell RNA-seq, scATAC-seq, and paired or unpaired multiomics SingleCellExperiment datasets, execution of the 56-measure evaluation suite, interactive bubble-matrix and ordination exploration, and export of publication-quality figures and tabular reports.
